msgstr "两次状态轮询之间的间隔，单位为秒，默认为 3。"

#: of qqqr.qr.QrLogin.login:20
msgid "if the QR code is not scanned after :obj:`refresh_times` expires."
msgstr "如果二维码在 :obj:`refresh_times` 次过期后仍未扫描。"

